        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVXGm9WOw5JDcwAnz-_cVqmslriqb311vgEGM7B0nyzQ7dDbibHPQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "We hired Les Toitures Deslauriers as our roofer of choice and we couldn't be happier. From the beginning Stephane walked us through the process with detailed explanation of products and installation and at a beyond reasonable price.\nThe whole team was courteous and professional with attention to detail. They also went above and beyond to ensure our four legged family member is safe.\nThanks to the entire Deslauriers roofing team.",
        "time": 1757689872,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "parminder singh Mangat",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113102313146950780631/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWHJvoasV_pZt2aRfsQLciam_TZnYxb9sy7urClqhZ91QHnIa5T=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "They have  done really very nice job.This roofer did very dedicated job. He is very sincere , because he took care of all our belongings and weather condition.He put roof very clean condition.we are vey happy with their services and strongly recommend.",
        "time": 1748284122,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Howard Pinchuk",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110706367284957834021/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL8BIwPxp2JbqPBesT1C-KHyAiqdr0-Wl_BXaQe93wVXQ1WVg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "We had such a great experience with Stephane and his team.  They were professional, reliable, and executed the job on time as promised with great attention to detail. The roof looks fantastic, and they left the lawn and driveway  clean and neat when finished. I highly recommend them for anyone needing quality roofing work!",
        "time": 1757714065,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Donna Scott",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117982051508905716736/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIQCYVDyJYl-FcZ0-4-zdDaQsJuOWM-YXPcaKdHls-owkschA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Excellent Roofing company. The owner came to our rescue when we being given the run around by another roofing company who was giving us the run around. They're are very professional, punctual, friendly, took care and time to protect our property from roof debris, excellent team, price is very reasonable. We were very happy with their service. I highly recommend.",
        "time": 1753401927,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Pete V",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116598024197773789553/reviews",
